@startuml

title ComService - Static View

package "ComService" {
    [Rx Ring Buffer Manager] as rxBuf
    note right of rxBuf
        - Stores incoming frames from Serial Driver
        - FIFO ring-buffer with head/tail pointers
        - Overflow detection
    end note

    [Tx Ring Buffer Manager] as txBuf
    note right of txBuf
        - Stores outgoing frames for Serial Driver
        - FIFO ring-buffer with head/tail pointers
        - Overflow detection
    end note

    [ComService Controller] as ctrl
    note right of ctrl
        - Registers RX/TX callbacks with Serial Driver
        - RX callback stores received data into Rx ring-buffer
        - Run() flushes Tx ring-buffer via SerialDriverUnit_Send()
        - Provides API for upper layers
    end note

    [RX Callback Handler] as rxCb
    note right of rxCb
        - Invoked from ISR context by Serial Driver
        - Writes received bytes into Rx ring-buffer
        - Re-arms SerialDriverUnit_Receive()
    end note

    [TX Callback Handler] as txCb
    note right of txCb
        - Invoked from ISR context by Serial Driver
        - Clears txBusy flag
    end note
}

[Serial Driver] as serialDriver
[Central App Controller] as cac

serialDriver --> rxCb : RxCallback (ISR context)
serialDriver --> txCb : TxCallback (ISR context)
rxCb --> rxBuf : Store received data
ctrl --> txBuf : Retrieve data to send
ctrl --> serialDriver : SerialDriverUnit_Send() / SerialDriverUnit_Receive()
cac --> ctrl : IsRxDataAvailable() / Read() / Write()
ctrl --> cac : Frame data / availability status

@enduml
